WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.687
These are the key habits from Module 10 State the
grain first

00:00:07.431 --> 00:00:13.297
Use conditional aggregation for pivots Use UNION ALL
or lateral

00:00:13.323 --> 00:00:19.019
VALUES for unpivoting Protect the distinction
between NULL and zero

00:00:20.762 --> 00:00:26.330
Validate totals and row counts And choose long or
wide form based on

00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:29.698
the downstream task not because one format is always
better
